# Frontend Architecture

- Pages orchestrate hooks + composition.
- API calls live in `features/*/api` or `shared/lib/api`.
- Presentation components do not own fetch logic.
- Prefer focused components (`CreatureCard`, `CreatureImage`) over mega pages.
- Preserve query params for search/type/page.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
useEffect(() => { fetch('/api/creatures').then(...) }, [])

// ✅ GOOD
const state = useCreatureCatalog(filters)
```
